                <pb facs="0487" n="427" sameAs="frus:frus1895p1/pg427"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Eustis to Mr.
                            Olney</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Paris</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-07-09"><hi rendition="#italic">July 9,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The French Chamber yesterday adopted unanimously the following resolution: <quote
                        rend="blockquote">
                        <p>The Chamber invites the Government to negotiate, as soon as possible, a
                            permanent treaty of arbitration between the French Republic and the
                            Republic of the United States of America.</p></quote></p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Eustis</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
